msgid ""
"Shelly's GUI needs <b>polkit</b> installed and running to authorize "
"privileged actions, but it wasn't found on the system bus.\n"
"\n"
"Install and enable it, then retry.\n"
"\n"
"<a href=\"https://www.seafoam-labs.org/shelly-alpm/docs/polkit/\">seafoam-"
"labs.org/shelly-alpm/docs/polkit</a>"
msgstr ""
"L'interface graphique de Shelly nécessite que <b>polkit</b> soit installé et "
